{"overview":"پیاده که به ته خط رسید، بازی عوض می شه بازیگر واقعی همون مهره ایه که دیده نمی شه مهره‌ای که نمی‌بینی، سرنوشتت رو رقم می زنه. حرکت بعدی همیشه از تو جلوتره. سربازی که به ته خط می رسه، سرباز نیست ... وزیره!","tagline":"","overview_en":"When a pawn reaches the end of the line, the game changes. The real player is the piece that is not seen. The piece that you do not see determines your fate. The next move is always ahead of you. A soldier that reaches the end of the line is not a soldier… it is a Queen!","tagline_en":"","runtime":50,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"Season 1","ep":51,"y":2025,"poster":""}],"episodes":51,"crew":["Bijan Mirbagheri"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"بهادر زمانی","role":"Major Siavash Kian","photo":"","en":"Bahador Zamani"},{"name":"Mahdi Zaminpardaz","role":"Masoud Bagheri (Aria Ardestani)","photo":"/aetGFmucViEAPL5acTPblosb3E.jpg"},{"name":"Payam Ahmadinia","role":"Mehrdad Sobhani (Danoosh)","photo":""},{"name":"Bahar Ghasemi","role":"Saghar Alizade","photo":""},{"name":"Siavash Gorjestani","role":"Alireza Sotoudeh","photo":""},{"name":"Mehdi Alipour","role":"Mehdi Alipour","photo":"/t46jaYIUId5KM4sbykxjHDxzB5.jpg"},{"name":"Mohsen Ghasabian","role":"Colonel Habib Mostaedi","photo":"/gzmLK6RluxZXaVjNV16UhTlzXi3.jpg"},{"name":"Amirkave Ahaninjan","role":"Samir Amir Jahani","photo":"/w1cvPX7TgfivRxSkMcNSOVH3EFm.jpg"},{"name":"Sam Nouri","role":"Parsa Emad","photo":"/6aXxVgGg7N74mUdv74FTZrWBolR.jpg"},{"name":"Alireza Raeisi","role":"Hamid Reza Kashani","photo":"/v8E7fD3JMqxo72LAiq0HjHxSmU3.jpg"}],"trailer":"vG9Z7zqKwx8","watch":{},"recs":["s2072"],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/302537"}